# THE CELLS OF CHAPTER 21 (second half) — F7 the firstborn's double (21:15-17), F8 the stubborn and rebellious son (21:18-21), F9 the hanged (21:22-23) (each ask a case; the verdicts DATA rows or PARAMETERS)
